{"type":"Film","id":"FR2016_156","slug":"fr2016-156-la-sociale","title":{"native":"La Sociale","english":""},"release":{"type":"Theatrical release","date":"2016-11-09","year":2016},"filmType":"Documentary","directors":[{"id":"Gilles Perret","slug":"gilles-perret","name":"Gilles Perret","birthYear":1968,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]}],"genre":["Documentary – Participatory mode"],"media":{"posterUrl":"https://medias.unifrance.org/medias/166/140/167078/format_page/la-sociale.jpg","trailerUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1ykrnRM3Vww"},"synopsis":{"native":"Il y a 70 ans, les ordonnances promulguant les champs d’application de la Sécurité sociale étaient votées par le Gouvernement provisoire de la République. Un vieux rêve séculaire émanant des peuples - vouloir vivre sans l’angoisse du lendemain - voyait enfin le jour. Le principal bâtisseur de cet édifice des plus humanistes qui soit se nommait Ambroise Croizat. Qui le connaît aujourd’hui ?","english":"Seventy years ago, the edicts promulgating the French social security were voted by the provisonary government of the Republic. A long-held secular dream emanating from the population - to be able to live without anxiety about the future - at last saw the light of day. Ambroise Croizat was the main builder of this most humanist of edifices. Who knows him today?"},"production":[{"country":"France","share":"Majority coproducer"}],"characters":[],"roles":[{"person":{"id":"Bernard Friot","slug":"bernard-friot","name":"Bernard Friot","birthYear":1946,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]},"role":"Documentary subject"},{"person":{"id":"Claude Reichman","slug":"claude-reichman","name":"Claude Reichman","birthYear":1937,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]},"role":"Documentary subject"},{"person":{"id":"François Rebsamen","slug":"francois-rebsamen","name":"François Rebsamen","birthYear":1951,"deathYe